  m_text: "In a single day, the Order of Truth condemned the knightslayer, reclaimed
    the Scepter of Truth, and brought swift justice for Grest. They called it a triumph,
    an opportunity that would bring in a new age of peace and order. With the passing
    of slightly stricter laws, the people of Isen fell further under the Order\u2019s
    ideals. Never had its influence been so complete."
